OL,3,GNEWSAConcern population will overwhelm
OL,4,Anew hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Durham county councillors
OL,7,Fquestioned whether it would be big
OL,8,Fenough whilst considering about 850
OL,9,Fsites across the borough for
OL,10,Fdevelopment in its new local plan.
OL,12,FThe hospital site is currently being
OL,13,Fprepared for construction, which is
OL,14,Fexpected to begin in September.
